Rax whitepaper source
=====================

Requirements
------------

GNU groff with pic, eqn, tbl, and the ms macro package; ps2pdf for PDF output.

Build
-----

    make

or directly:

    groff -pet -ms -Tps rax-whitepaper.ms > finished.ps
    ps2pdf finished.ps finished.pdf

The -p, -e, and -t options run pic, eqn, and tbl respectively.

Check formatting without retaining output:

    make check
